  "limitations": [
    "Only serialized CPU0 polled controller transport; sleeping USB work still drains from kernel input/IRQ polling context, not a complete scheduler/workqueue port",
    "Transport accepts control and interrupt-IN only; SG/bulk/iso/interrupt-OUT rejected",
    "Canonical input adapter exposes Boot key/mouse class paths, not the complete Linux input subsystem",
    "Full canonical HID-core/usbhid pending; no generic tablet support in this build",
    "Entropy ingestion hook has no kernel pool API and remains explicitly inactive; no entropy is credited",
    "Init failure rollback, reset/clear-halt and endpoint reservation rollback need further integrated coverage",
    "No physical IRQ/IOMMU/noncoherent/system-PM or physical ASRock proof",
    "Final installation, Recovery firmware input, UI/layout/deletion and license/source gates remain separate"
  ]
